config VIDEO_APPLE_AVE_PROBE
	tristate "Apple silicon video encoder firmware probe"
	depends on ARCH_APPLE || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF && IOMMU_DMA && PM
	select CRC32
	help
	  A test driver for the video encoder (AVE) of Apple silicon SoCs:
	  it powers the first encoder and runs the boot handshake with the
	  firmware iBoot preloads, logging the replies. It encodes nothing,
	  and binds only with its stop_after module option.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called apple-ave-probe.
